# Cursor Rules for XZ-Manipulator-Controls

Before performing any tasks in this repository, read and follow:
VisionSystem/REMEDIATION_PLAN_AI.md

Key mandates:
1. Fix angle calculation quantization in VisionSystem/04_Source_Code/utils/angle_calculator.py (must support continuous 0-360 deg).
2. Upgrade UART protocol to include (X, Y) physical coordinates in mm, object ID, and CRC16 checksum for STM32 Cartesian Manipulator.
3. Debounce detections using spatial tracking to prevent frame-rate UART flooding.
4. Remove destructive NVS Flash writes and blocking delays from firmware_esp32.ino.
5. Fix all hardcoded user paths in .bat launchers.
6. Verify all changes with automated tests before completing.
